<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Admission Submitted</title>

<style>
body{
    margin:0;
    font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
    background:#0f172a;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    height:100vh;
}

.card{
    width:500px;
    background:#1e293b;
    padding:40px;
    border-radius:15px;
    text-align:center;
    box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
}

.icon{
    font-size:70px;
    color:#22c55e;
}

h1{
    color:#fff;
    margin-top:20px;
}

p{
    color:#cbd5e1;
    line-height:28px;
}

a{
    display:inline-block;
    margin-top:25px;
    padding:12px 30px;
    background:#2563eb;
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    border-radius:8px;
    font-weight:bold;
}

a:hover{
    background:#1d4ed8;
}
</style>

</head>
<body>

<div class="card">

<div class="icon">✅</div>

<h1>Admission Submitted Successfully</h1>

<p>
Your hostel admission request has been submitted successfully.
</p>

<p>
Please wait for Warden approval. You will receive your Hostel ID after approval.
</p>

<a href="/public_admission">Submit Another Admission</a>

</div>

</body>
</html>